&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:36pt;"&gt;（当事業年度において株式数が減少した銘柄）&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｃ．特定投資株式及びみなし保有株式の銘柄ごとの株式数、貸借対照表計上額等に関する情報&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;特定投資株式&lt;/p&gt;
